From rfzampieri em gmail.com  Sun Oct 12 22:58:04 2014
From: rfzampieri em gmail.com (Ricardo Fernando Zampieri)
Date: Sun, 12 Oct 2014 22:58:04 +0000
Subject: Re: [R-br] Estimar assimetria e curtose
In-Reply-To: <CAAjbdiLfv+W7A17qrHCkLNRN8DCa2zC17aRpbWq8aYpS-O92HA@mail.gmail.com>
